{
  "quest.1887BB9F14E9CCAC.title": "The Atlas",
  "quest.1887BB9F14E9CCAC.quest_subtitle": "Center-block discovery list",
  "quest.1887BB9F14E9CCAC.quest_desc": [
    "This chapter is the &6Randon Atlas&r checklist — the curated &eendgame set&r of blocks that only count when they roll from your island &acenter random block&r.",
    "",
    "Each quest below is one Atlas page. It completes when that block is rolled for your team (or you can check it for &e10 XP&r if you already have it).",
    "",
    "Progress also shows in chat: &f/randomblock atlas&r and &f/randomblock atlas missing&r.",
    "",
    "Unlocking mod pools can &aexpand&r which pages are required for full completion. Check the box when you are ready to hunt pages."
  ],
